1
00:00:01,318 --> 00:00:02,586
(This drama merged facts with fiction
and plots may differ from records.)

2
00:00:02,653 --> 00:00:03,921
(Children and animals were filmed
with the aid of guardians and experts.)

3
00:00:03,987 --> 00:00:04,988
(Some scenes were made
using generative AI.)

4
00:00:10,627 --> 00:00:13,831
As long as I live,

5
00:00:14,598 --> 00:00:18,068
no one shall ever...

6
00:00:22,673 --> 00:00:25,676
invade Goguryeo!

7
00:00:45,629 --> 00:00:47,831
It is a rebellion!

8
00:01:40,350 --> 00:01:42,286
Protect His Majesty!

9
00:02:17,654 --> 00:02:18,655
Oh, my!

10
00:02:21,391 --> 00:02:22,993
How dare you!

11
00:03:44,174 --> 00:03:45,375
Where are you going?

12
00:04:21,945 --> 00:04:25,315
Gae So Mun, you bastard!

13
00:04:27,384 --> 00:04:30,087
Your Majesty, you must leave immediately.

14
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:31,655
Think only...

15
00:04:32,522 --> 00:04:33,757
of Goguryeo.

16
00:05:20,203 --> 00:05:24,007
Dismiss Kim Chun Chu and behead him.

17
00:05:24,474 --> 00:05:29,146
- Behead Kim Chun Chu.
- Behead Kim Chun Chu.

18
00:05:29,212 --> 00:05:33,250
- Behead Kim Chun Chu.
- Behead Kim Chun Chu.

19
00:05:33,750 --> 00:05:36,386
- Behead Kim Chun Chu.
- Behead Kim Chun Chu.

20
00:05:36,453 --> 00:05:37,754
(Kim Beop Min, eldest son of Kim Chun Chu)

21
00:05:37,821 --> 00:05:40,190
General Kim Yu Sin has arrived.

22
00:05:40,257 --> 00:05:41,725
(Bi Dam, minister of Silla, a Jingol)

23
00:05:48,398 --> 00:05:50,700
(Kim Yu Sin, Supreme General of Silla)

24
00:05:53,069 --> 00:05:54,905
(Kim Jin Ju, minister of Silla, a Jingol)

25
00:06:05,048 --> 00:06:06,116
Your Majesty.

26
00:06:06,850 --> 00:06:10,620
Those who disobey their monarch
and cause a rift...

27
00:06:10,687 --> 00:06:12,422
are not worthy to have Silla blood.

28
00:06:13,089 --> 00:06:16,893
Behead those who go against you,
uphold law and order within,

29
00:06:17,494 --> 00:06:19,663
and prepare to fight Baekje.

30
00:06:48,024 --> 00:06:49,092
Your Majesty.

31
00:06:49,826 --> 00:06:52,629
Your disloyal servant
is returning in three years.

32
00:06:57,100 --> 00:06:58,235
General.

33
00:06:58,301 --> 00:07:01,504
As if leaving your post
on the Goguryeo border was not bad enough,

34
00:07:01,838 --> 00:07:04,541
you have now abandoned the front
to bring your troops to Seorabeol.

35
00:07:05,842 --> 00:07:09,212
Who sent you word to leave the border?

36
00:07:09,279 --> 00:07:11,882
Know your place!

37
00:07:12,749 --> 00:07:16,319
I am a general who serves
the command of Her Majesty.

38
00:07:19,723 --> 00:07:23,393
Your Majesty, I left my main army
at the Goguryeo border...

39
00:07:23,660 --> 00:07:25,729
and traveled here with six men.

40
00:07:26,162 --> 00:07:29,165
And it is because I foresaw
this very situation.

41
00:07:31,234 --> 00:07:35,171
The Minister of Military Affairs' duty
is to execute those who retreat.

42
00:07:35,238 --> 00:07:37,941
Baek Ryong had come
to relay important information.

43
00:07:39,776 --> 00:07:43,280
If we cannot behead Baek Ryong,
who left his fortress and caused a rift,

44
00:07:44,814 --> 00:07:46,850
what of the soldiers outside?

45
00:07:47,617 --> 00:07:50,687
Anyone who defends Baek Ryong
is an accomplice.

46
00:07:51,588 --> 00:07:54,024
Silla's greatest threat
does not come from the outside,

47
00:07:54,891 --> 00:07:57,093
but from the division within.

48
00:07:58,061 --> 00:08:00,931
While my men give their lives
to hold the border,

49
00:08:00,997 --> 00:08:03,600
the Jingol nobles in the capital...

50
00:08:04,067 --> 00:08:08,171
sat idly and refused
to send their own troops to war!

51
00:08:10,540 --> 00:08:12,475
If anyone serves their own interests
above Silla's...

52
00:08:12,876 --> 00:08:14,911
and causes internal division,

53
00:08:15,445 --> 00:08:17,714
do they not deserve to be beheaded?

54
00:08:20,884 --> 00:08:22,285
Your Majesty.

55
00:08:22,352 --> 00:08:25,956
If you believe Silla's future depends
on eliminating those of Gaya descent,

56
00:08:26,957 --> 00:08:29,292
I ask that you kill me and my men first.

57
00:08:30,994 --> 00:08:33,863
Though these men scorn me
for my Gaya blood,

58
00:08:34,164 --> 00:08:40,370
I have risked my life in battle
to prove my loyalty to Silla.

59
00:08:41,571 --> 00:08:42,973
My men outside...

60
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:46,876
have Gaya blood in their veins...

61
00:08:47,444 --> 00:08:48,979
but have fought for Silla
for over ten years.

62
00:08:49,879 --> 00:08:52,415
They were not even
aware of their heritage!

63
00:08:55,318 --> 00:08:58,355
If we must die to save Silla,

64
00:08:59,889 --> 00:09:02,258
then we will willingly
give our lives here.

65
00:09:20,877 --> 00:09:23,680
This is my command as Ruler of Silla.

66
00:09:24,647 --> 00:09:27,984
Kim Chun Chu will remain
Minister of Military Affairs...

67
00:09:28,051 --> 00:09:30,587
and guard Daeyaseong Fortress.

68
00:09:31,287 --> 00:09:32,956
As for you, General Kim Yu Sin,

69
00:09:33,390 --> 00:09:36,459
take 3,000 cavalry from Seorabeol...

70
00:09:37,027 --> 00:09:39,229
and take up position outside the capital.

71
00:10:05,789 --> 00:10:09,492
(Episode 2: A Fortress of Madmen)

72
00:10:10,293 --> 00:10:12,162
(Taiji Palace, Chang'an, Tang Dynasty)

73
00:10:14,931 --> 00:10:18,134
Li Shiji, Commander
of the Shuozhou Expeditionary Army,

74
00:10:18,201 --> 00:10:21,104
has returned after conquering Xueyantuo.

75
00:10:21,171 --> 00:10:24,174
Your Majesty's territory...

76
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:27,477
now stretches 3,735km from east to west,

77
00:10:27,544 --> 00:10:32,148
and 4,288km from north to south.

78
00:10:32,982 --> 00:10:38,588
- We hail the conqueror of the world.
- We hail the conqueror of the world.

79
00:10:40,056 --> 00:10:42,092
(Li Shimin, Emperor of Tang)

80
00:10:43,159 --> 00:10:46,629
(Goguryeo)

81
00:11:06,749 --> 00:11:08,985
The map shows there are other nations.

82
00:11:09,686 --> 00:11:11,387
So how can I say
that I have conquered the world?

83
00:11:15,158 --> 00:11:16,292
Your Majesty.

84
00:11:16,826 --> 00:11:19,095
If you were to give me 30,000 men,

85
00:11:19,496 --> 00:11:21,798
I will take Liaodong and Pyongyangseong...

86
00:11:22,198 --> 00:11:24,534
and bring you the head of Goguryeo's king.

87
00:11:25,068 --> 00:11:26,069
Your Majesty.

88
00:11:26,136 --> 00:11:27,170
(Zhangsun Wuji, Tang's minister)

89
00:11:27,237 --> 00:11:28,605
Goguryeo is cold and barren,

90
00:11:28,671 --> 00:11:31,307
and the people are known
to be fierce and violent.

91
00:11:31,374 --> 00:11:34,110
They are not worth
the effort of conquering.

92
00:11:40,984 --> 00:11:42,919
Is there ever an exception to conquering?

93
00:11:43,186 --> 00:11:46,156
Emperor Yang of Sui
lost a million men in Goguryeo...

94
00:11:46,222 --> 00:11:48,558
and brought about his dynasty's fall.

95
00:11:49,259 --> 00:11:52,795
Do not underestimate Ko Geon Mu,
who defeated Emperor Yang.

96
00:11:53,229 --> 00:11:58,001
On top of that,
there are too many strong fortresses.

97
00:11:58,368 --> 00:12:01,371
(Sui)

98
00:12:08,144 --> 00:12:10,280
Because Emperor Yang failed,

99
00:12:10,947 --> 00:12:12,315
you believe I will fail also?

100
00:12:13,816 --> 00:12:16,352
You think I cannot beat Ko Geon Mu?

101
00:12:16,419 --> 00:12:17,720
That is preposterous!

102
00:12:18,555 --> 00:12:23,426
You united the realm and subjugated
nations without suffering a defeat.

103
00:12:23,493 --> 00:12:27,063
I would not dare compare you
to the ruler of a fallen dynasty.

104
00:12:27,564 --> 00:12:28,598
I merely mean...

105
00:12:29,032 --> 00:12:31,467
that Goguryeo is cold and useless...

106
00:12:31,534 --> 00:12:32,602
Zhangsun Wuji!

107
00:12:39,909 --> 00:12:43,479
Your Majesty,
Grand Preceptor Wei Zheng is entering.

108
00:12:55,225 --> 00:12:57,527
(Wei Zheng, Tang's Grand Preceptor)

109
00:13:00,897 --> 00:13:02,465
Your Majesty.

110
00:13:03,933 --> 00:13:05,168
I miss the days...

111
00:13:05,735 --> 00:13:06,970
when you and I,

112
00:13:07,670 --> 00:13:10,873
with Li Shinji and Zhangsun Wuji,

113
00:13:11,808 --> 00:13:15,245
raided and conquered
the Western Regions...

114
00:13:16,279 --> 00:13:19,015
and the northern lands.

115
00:13:24,187 --> 00:13:26,623
We can still share more victories.

116
00:13:27,156 --> 00:13:28,825
Ko Geon Mu of Goguryeo...

117
00:13:29,692 --> 00:13:31,427
fears you, Your Majesty.

118
00:13:31,828 --> 00:13:34,497
He voluntarily destroyed
the monuments at the border...

119
00:13:34,564 --> 00:13:36,499
and strives to preserve peace with us.

120
00:13:36,566 --> 00:13:39,602
Therefore, Goguryeo is
as good as yours now.

121
00:13:40,570 --> 00:13:41,771
Your Majesty.

122
00:13:42,071 --> 00:13:46,109
Many men from Shandong Province
were conscripted for war,

123
00:13:46,643 --> 00:13:49,112
so the region still suffers.

124
00:13:49,679 --> 00:13:53,016
If you attack Goguryeo
when it has already submitted,

125
00:13:53,816 --> 00:13:56,586
you may obtain more land...

126
00:13:57,720 --> 00:14:00,490
but risk the resentment
of an exhausted people.

127
00:14:01,724 --> 00:14:04,627
However, if you were to find cause
to conquer Goguryeo...

128
00:14:04,694 --> 00:14:07,463
after our people had time to recover,

129
00:14:08,464 --> 00:14:10,199
your people and your ministers...

130
00:14:10,733 --> 00:14:14,570
will willingly give their lives for you.

131
00:14:18,174 --> 00:14:19,509
I am aware...

132
00:14:20,376 --> 00:14:22,779
that I do not have long to live.

133
00:14:25,415 --> 00:14:27,250
But when the time comes to mobilize,

134
00:14:29,285 --> 00:14:30,486
I will assist you...

135
00:14:32,221 --> 00:14:33,956
in your endeavors...

136
00:14:35,191 --> 00:14:36,726
from the afterlife.

137
00:14:57,613 --> 00:15:00,049
I know the depth of your loyalty.

138
00:15:05,288 --> 00:15:06,689
I will bide my time.

139
00:15:08,825 --> 00:15:12,462
- We thank you, Your Majesty.
- We thank you, Your Majesty.

140
00:15:14,997 --> 00:15:16,366
Zhangsun Wuji.

141
00:15:17,233 --> 00:15:20,737
Follow Wei Zheng's counsel
and focus on the people's recovery.

142
00:15:21,504 --> 00:15:22,505
Meanwhile,

143
00:15:23,373 --> 00:15:25,475
all commanders, including Li Shiji,

144
00:15:25,775 --> 00:15:28,478
are to train and prepare for a future war.

145
00:15:28,544 --> 00:15:30,747
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

146
00:15:40,356 --> 00:15:42,892
(Goguryeo)

147
00:16:16,426 --> 00:16:18,094
(Ko Yeon Mu, Goguryeo's general)

148
00:16:18,494 --> 00:16:19,762
(Ko Geon Mu, 27th ruler of Goguryeo)

149
00:16:23,032 --> 00:16:25,001
Has Pyongyangseong...

150
00:16:25,902 --> 00:16:26,969
finally fallen?

151
00:16:28,204 --> 00:16:29,472
We cannot be certain...

152
00:16:30,540 --> 00:16:32,008
from this distance.

153
00:16:49,225 --> 00:16:50,259
- Your Majesty.
- Your Majesty.

154
00:16:54,297 --> 00:16:55,698
Are you all that remain?

155
00:16:55,765 --> 00:16:56,799
(Seondo Hae, Goguryeo minister)

156
00:16:58,501 --> 00:17:02,772
Your Majesty,
retreat to Liaodong and bide your time.

157
00:17:03,439 --> 00:17:06,843
Ko Jeong Eui's Central Army
lies in ambush near Sasu.

158
00:17:07,410 --> 00:17:08,511
I will join them.

159
00:17:11,314 --> 00:17:12,748
But Ko Jeong Eui and the Central Army...

160
00:17:13,316 --> 00:17:14,984
(Ko Jung San, Goguryeo's general)

161
00:17:15,051 --> 00:17:16,853
They have sided with Yeon Gae So Mun.

162
00:17:17,386 --> 00:17:18,387
What?

163
00:17:20,089 --> 00:17:21,424
Ko Jeong Eui...

164
00:17:23,125 --> 00:17:24,260
betrayed me?

165
00:17:25,094 --> 00:17:26,362
Please head to Liaodong.

166
00:17:26,829 --> 00:17:29,198
Our fortresses there still stand strong.

167
00:17:29,265 --> 00:17:32,468
There, you can escape Yeon Gae So Mun.

168
00:17:39,609 --> 00:17:41,210
I will go to Pyongyangseong.

169
00:17:43,546 --> 00:17:45,548
My men are there.

170
00:17:46,582 --> 00:17:48,084
Not even Yeon Gae So Mun...

171
00:17:49,986 --> 00:17:53,089
could have taken Pyongyangseong.

172
00:17:55,024 --> 00:17:56,792
You must go to Liaodong.

173
00:18:11,340 --> 00:18:12,808
Pyongyangseong...

174
00:18:14,577 --> 00:18:15,678
is where I will go.

175
00:19:35,858 --> 00:19:37,526
Welcome, Your Majesty.

176
00:19:38,794 --> 00:19:39,795
(Ko Juk Ri, Western Commander)

177
00:19:39,862 --> 00:19:41,063
Give His Majesty a warm welcome!

178
00:20:01,784 --> 00:20:02,985
Make way!

179
00:20:07,690 --> 00:20:08,924
I will clear the path.

180
00:20:57,073 --> 00:20:59,442
- Surrender.
- Release me!

181
00:20:59,508 --> 00:21:01,744
Let me go, you traitors!

182
00:21:01,811 --> 00:21:02,845
Release me!

183
00:21:02,912 --> 00:21:04,413
(Geom Mo Jam, Goguryeo's general)

184
00:22:01,237 --> 00:22:05,541
Your Majesty!

185
00:22:48,818 --> 00:22:50,419
Do you think...

186
00:22:51,120 --> 00:22:53,923
this will make the world yours?

187
00:22:55,624 --> 00:22:56,625
Escort the King.

188
00:24:20,075 --> 00:24:21,176
(Ah Jin Ham, Kim Yu Sin's loyal servant)

189
00:24:21,243 --> 00:24:22,878
Daeyaseong is not far from here.

190
00:24:39,628 --> 00:24:43,899
- Will you be going to Tang, In Mun?
- Yes.

191
00:24:43,966 --> 00:24:45,167
That is good news.

192
00:24:45,567 --> 00:24:47,336
You must see a bigger world.

193
00:24:50,172 --> 00:24:54,443
I never thought we would be drinking
together here in Seorabeol.

194
00:24:59,515 --> 00:25:00,649
How is the tea?

195
00:25:00,883 --> 00:25:04,153
I had it prepared specially for you.

196
00:25:05,454 --> 00:25:07,122
If you had not appeared when you did,

197
00:25:07,189 --> 00:25:10,059
our father would have been
in great trouble.

198
00:25:10,125 --> 00:25:11,293
Thank you, Uncle.

199
00:25:12,895 --> 00:25:15,898
How do you think I knew to come?

200
00:25:16,131 --> 00:25:17,132
Pardon?

201
00:25:18,233 --> 00:25:20,936
"Things are brewing on the Baekje border."

202
00:25:21,003 --> 00:25:24,840
"Bi Dam and his cohorts
will most definitely plot something."

203
00:25:25,474 --> 00:25:29,445
Your father warned me in advance.

204
00:25:30,145 --> 00:25:31,146
Father.

205
00:25:31,747 --> 00:25:34,249
They will not be able to use
our Gaya ancestry...

206
00:25:34,783 --> 00:25:36,852
against us for a while.

207
00:25:42,958 --> 00:25:43,959
Beop Min.

208
00:25:46,996 --> 00:25:49,732
What is your ultimate goal?

209
00:25:52,601 --> 00:25:54,370
It is time you wielded a sword...

210
00:25:55,237 --> 00:25:56,905
for your country.

211
00:26:26,568 --> 00:26:27,703
(Baekje, the enemy)

212
00:26:27,770 --> 00:26:30,539
This place belonged to Gaya,
then to Baekje.

213
00:26:30,773 --> 00:26:33,175
And now it belongs to Silla.

214
00:26:33,742 --> 00:26:35,944
These people merely
lived their lives on this land.

215
00:26:36,378 --> 00:26:38,147
Once, they were Gaya people.

216
00:26:38,714 --> 00:26:40,249
Yesterday, they were Baekje people.

217
00:26:40,716 --> 00:26:42,951
Today, they are the people of Silla.

218
00:26:44,286 --> 00:26:47,723
Officials think
they will betray Silla easily,

219
00:26:48,223 --> 00:26:50,426
so they leave these terrifying warnings.

220
00:26:52,061 --> 00:26:54,730
Was this General Kim Pum Seok's doing?

221
00:26:54,797 --> 00:26:58,367
Any general of Silla would do the same.

222
00:26:59,168 --> 00:27:00,569
If Baekje were to take over again,

223
00:27:00,969 --> 00:27:02,504
its people would do so as well.

224
00:27:03,939 --> 00:27:05,574
If there is a living hell,

225
00:27:06,575 --> 00:27:08,210
this would be it.

226
00:27:45,414 --> 00:27:46,448
Father.

227
00:27:50,452 --> 00:27:52,354
- You sensed it too?
- Yes.

228
00:27:54,289 --> 00:27:56,825
- Which direction?
- Behind us to the right.

229
00:27:57,392 --> 00:27:59,228
There are not many of them.

230
00:28:01,196 --> 00:28:02,431
Watch your back.

231
00:28:08,804 --> 00:28:09,838
Who goes there?

232
00:28:10,939 --> 00:28:11,974
Show yourself!

233
00:28:17,813 --> 00:28:20,649
I am Kim Chun Chu,
Silla's Minister of Military Affairs.

234
00:28:21,917 --> 00:28:24,920
I am on the way to see Kim Pum Seok,
the lord of Daeyaseong.

235
00:28:25,921 --> 00:28:27,956
If you do not wish to fight us,

236
00:28:28,991 --> 00:28:30,425
show yourselves.

237
00:28:32,461 --> 00:28:34,229
You are going to see Kim Pum Seok?

238
00:28:36,565 --> 00:28:37,566
Yes.

239
00:28:38,300 --> 00:28:39,601
We are not the enemy.

240
00:28:40,903 --> 00:28:42,671
We are Silla men, the same as you.

241
00:28:44,540 --> 00:28:46,909
You are going to Kim Pum Seok,
yet claim you are not the enemy?

242
00:28:48,310 --> 00:28:49,578
If you stand with him,

243
00:28:50,579 --> 00:28:52,581
you are murderers as well.

244
00:29:10,899 --> 00:29:11,900
Father.

245
00:29:38,260 --> 00:29:40,729
If you were wronged, I will avenge you.

246
00:29:42,297 --> 00:29:45,367
If Kim Pum Seok is guilty of something,
I will uncover the truth.

247
00:29:46,935 --> 00:29:48,403
Show yourselves!

248
00:29:50,872 --> 00:29:52,874
I swear it on my name.

249
00:30:35,250 --> 00:30:38,353
Will you please hear our plight?

250
00:30:41,256 --> 00:30:43,125
Lord Kim Pum Seok...

251
00:30:43,825 --> 00:30:47,996
called my mother a spy
just because she was of Baekje descent.

252
00:30:49,798 --> 00:30:50,799
Look at her now.

253
00:31:13,021 --> 00:31:16,358
I, Kim Pum Seok, just saved your life.

254
00:31:20,162 --> 00:31:21,596
Welcome, sir.

255
00:31:22,097 --> 00:31:23,332
Hello, Beop Min.

256
00:31:25,267 --> 00:31:29,071
Welcome to Daeyaseong,
the front line of Silla.

257
00:31:37,846 --> 00:31:39,981
(Sabiseong, Baekje)

258
00:31:52,527 --> 00:31:54,029
Still no news from Daeyaseong?

259
00:31:55,731 --> 00:31:58,734
We have taken 40 fortresses
in Daeya Province.

260
00:31:58,800 --> 00:31:59,935
(King Uija, 31st ruler of Baekje)

261
00:32:00,001 --> 00:32:03,271
Why have we not heard any good news yet?

262
00:32:04,773 --> 00:32:08,377
It is the strongest fortress
in all of Silla.

263
00:32:08,944 --> 00:32:12,748
We know so little
of the situation within its walls.

264
00:32:16,451 --> 00:32:17,719
First, you blamed our shortage of men.

265
00:32:18,286 --> 00:32:19,788
Then, you blamed Kim Yu Sin.

266
00:32:20,555 --> 00:32:22,624
Now you blame a lack of intelligence?

267
00:32:23,725 --> 00:32:25,494
Do you plan to leave Daeyaseong...

268
00:32:25,961 --> 00:32:28,196
and make a detour to Seorabeol?

269
00:32:32,968 --> 00:32:34,302
It has been 100 years.

270
00:32:35,370 --> 00:32:36,805
King Seong lost his life...

271
00:32:38,273 --> 00:32:41,410
to those Silla barbarians 100 years ago!

272
00:32:45,046 --> 00:32:46,715
It has been a whole century.

273
00:32:48,850 --> 00:32:50,452
The dogs...

274
00:32:51,787 --> 00:32:53,522
broke our alliance,

275
00:32:54,055 --> 00:32:55,056
betrayed King Seong,

276
00:32:55,891 --> 00:32:58,894
and took his head as a trophy of war.

277
00:33:00,262 --> 00:33:03,598
They still control our Dangseong
and Daeyaseong.

278
00:33:05,133 --> 00:33:07,002
I have yet to avenge my ancestor.

279
00:33:09,604 --> 00:33:10,672
How am I to bear...

280
00:33:12,908 --> 00:33:14,042
this humiliation?

281
00:33:23,051 --> 00:33:25,387
I will bleed the people of Silla dry...

282
00:33:25,887 --> 00:33:29,357
and paint Wolseong Palace red
with their blood.

283
00:33:30,859 --> 00:33:32,527
I will scatter their bones...

284
00:33:33,261 --> 00:33:35,664
across the kingdom.

285
00:33:35,730 --> 00:33:38,834
Until I do that,
I do not think I can say...

286
00:33:40,535 --> 00:33:42,404
I have done my duty.

287
00:33:44,506 --> 00:33:45,941
With my own hands,

288
00:33:48,477 --> 00:33:50,812
I will tear out that queen's heart.

289
00:33:55,250 --> 00:33:56,885
Only then will I sleep in peace.

290
00:34:06,328 --> 00:34:07,329
My dear ministers.

291
00:34:13,702 --> 00:34:14,803
As usual,

292
00:34:16,771 --> 00:34:18,707
you are silent.

293
00:34:22,110 --> 00:34:23,612
Then I will go...

294
00:34:24,779 --> 00:34:26,448
topple Daeyaseong myself.

295
00:34:27,816 --> 00:34:29,017
Your Majesty!

296
00:34:29,885 --> 00:34:31,987
I will stake my life upon...

297
00:34:32,521 --> 00:34:36,825
destroying Daeyaseong within three days!

298
00:34:36,892 --> 00:34:39,227
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

299
00:34:39,861 --> 00:34:42,297
I will go!

300
00:34:42,364 --> 00:34:45,500
Please send me!

301
00:34:46,635 --> 00:34:47,903
Your Majesty.

302
00:34:56,945 --> 00:34:58,446
(Baekje)

303
00:34:58,513 --> 00:35:00,048
(Silla)

304
00:35:12,761 --> 00:35:15,330
(Daeyaseong, Silla)

305
00:35:24,606 --> 00:35:26,608
(Kim Go Ta So, Kim Pum Seok's wife,
Kim Chun Chu's daughter)

306
00:35:40,989 --> 00:35:42,657
Grandpa!

307
00:35:53,234 --> 00:35:54,235
My dear child.

308
00:35:55,236 --> 00:35:57,339
You have grown a great deal.

309
00:36:00,575 --> 00:36:02,978
The baby looks just like you, Go Ta So.

310
00:36:04,946 --> 00:36:05,947
Yes.

311
00:36:07,182 --> 00:36:10,552
The Baekje army was nearby.
Were you in any danger?

312
00:36:12,087 --> 00:36:13,088
Not at all.

313
00:36:13,922 --> 00:36:15,457
We got here safely, as you can see.

314
00:36:18,226 --> 00:36:19,828
Is that true, Beop Min?

315
00:36:21,262 --> 00:36:23,098
I did not see any Baekje soldiers.

316
00:36:26,067 --> 00:36:27,836
Then I am glad.

317
00:36:28,536 --> 00:36:29,804
Welcome.

318
00:36:40,048 --> 00:36:41,049
Come on!

319
00:36:44,252 --> 00:36:45,253
Let us go inside.

320
00:37:06,107 --> 00:37:09,310
You could have sent me...

321
00:37:10,011 --> 00:37:13,648
to Seorabeol instead of Kim Yu Sin.

322
00:37:13,715 --> 00:37:15,817
You are the governor of Daeya Province.

323
00:37:17,018 --> 00:37:18,953
You are at the front lines...

324
00:37:19,421 --> 00:37:22,223
and hold the most important duty
of defending us from Baekje.

325
00:37:22,290 --> 00:37:23,491
True.

326
00:37:24,492 --> 00:37:27,095
I know very well
that I must defend Seorabeol.

327
00:37:28,596 --> 00:37:33,468
But I am sick and tired
of all that defending.

328
00:37:34,436 --> 00:37:36,337
It has been four years.

329
00:37:39,174 --> 00:37:41,309
Staying behind the walls
to defend a province?

330
00:37:44,279 --> 00:37:46,748
My wife would be better at it.

331
00:37:52,353 --> 00:37:53,388
Well...

332
00:37:54,389 --> 00:37:57,659
As you know, my husband led
the Battle of Okmungok to victory.

333
00:37:57,726 --> 00:38:00,095
He is a warrior at heart.

334
00:38:04,065 --> 00:38:09,037
I am still washing the blood
from that battle from my hands.

335
00:38:10,905 --> 00:38:12,006
Yes.

336
00:38:13,007 --> 00:38:16,478
If it were not for you,
Bi Dam would be dead.

337
00:38:18,480 --> 00:38:21,449
I saved Bi Dam at Okmungok...

338
00:38:23,485 --> 00:38:26,721
and almost died at the hands
of a Baekje soldier.

339
00:38:30,091 --> 00:38:31,092
So why...

340
00:38:33,294 --> 00:38:35,964
does this fortress I risked my life for...

341
00:38:37,398 --> 00:38:39,968
seem so insignificant?

342
00:38:42,737 --> 00:38:44,172
My dear father-in-law,

343
00:38:47,342 --> 00:38:48,476
why did you save me...

344
00:38:49,511 --> 00:38:51,913
by exchanging prisoners of war?

345
00:38:58,453 --> 00:39:00,622
I am tired,
so I will retire for the night.

346
00:39:30,618 --> 00:39:34,289
Only you two can put me in a good mood.

347
00:39:53,007 --> 00:39:54,209
- Spare me!
- Please!

348
00:39:54,275 --> 00:39:55,410
- Help!
- Please spare me!

349
00:39:55,476 --> 00:39:57,345
- Free me!
- Let us go!

350
00:39:57,412 --> 00:39:58,947
- Please!
- Spare me!

351
00:39:59,013 --> 00:40:00,248
Spare my life.

352
00:40:00,315 --> 00:40:02,016
Please do not kill me.

353
00:40:04,018 --> 00:40:05,620
Speak up or die!

354
00:40:06,354 --> 00:40:08,456
Save us, General.

355
00:40:08,523 --> 00:40:10,058
- Please!
- Save us!

356
00:40:11,392 --> 00:40:13,761
General, please save us.

357
00:40:14,162 --> 00:40:15,296
Kill me.

358
00:40:17,398 --> 00:40:18,900
Execute the Silla men.

359
00:40:20,134 --> 00:40:21,469
General! Save us!

360
00:40:24,572 --> 00:40:26,140
Save us, General.

361
00:40:26,808 --> 00:40:29,677
They just want to know
the way to Seorabeol.

362
00:40:30,078 --> 00:40:32,881
The road that only you know!

363
00:40:33,147 --> 00:40:34,649
Tell them...

364
00:40:35,016 --> 00:40:37,151
so we can live!

365
00:40:37,886 --> 00:40:40,855
Help us, General!

366
00:41:05,480 --> 00:41:08,449
You wench. You are a Baekje spy.

367
00:41:08,850 --> 00:41:10,585
You must be here to hand me over to them.

368
00:41:15,256 --> 00:41:16,257
General!

369
00:41:17,625 --> 00:41:18,726
How dare you?

370
00:41:19,627 --> 00:41:21,663
Do you have a death wish?

371
00:41:23,831 --> 00:41:24,832
No, General.

372
00:41:31,139 --> 00:41:33,207
You have a Baekje wife.

373
00:41:34,108 --> 00:41:36,377
Did you throw her out?

374
00:41:36,444 --> 00:41:38,046
(Geom Il, Silla's official)

375
00:41:38,980 --> 00:41:39,981
Yes, sir.

376
00:41:40,348 --> 00:41:41,349
I did as you commanded.

377
00:41:42,817 --> 00:41:43,985
Your wife...

378
00:41:45,019 --> 00:41:47,088
was a great beauty.

379
00:41:48,723 --> 00:41:50,925
What a waste.

380
00:41:53,995 --> 00:41:55,229
Her misfortune...

381
00:41:56,731 --> 00:41:58,299
was being from Baekje.

382
00:42:27,395 --> 00:42:28,730
Help us.

383
00:42:29,130 --> 00:42:32,000
Help us. Get us out of here.

384
00:42:32,867 --> 00:42:35,103
- Please.
- Save us.

385
00:42:35,503 --> 00:42:36,904
Save us.

386
00:42:36,971 --> 00:42:39,907
- Please help.
- Get us out of here!

387
00:42:39,974 --> 00:42:41,476
- Help me.
- Save my life.

388
00:42:41,542 --> 00:42:44,112
My family will starve without me!

389
00:42:46,114 --> 00:42:49,217
My lord! Will you please save me?

390
00:42:49,450 --> 00:42:52,053
Kim Pum Seok will kill us tomorrow!

391
00:42:52,120 --> 00:42:55,189
We do not have long to live!

392
00:42:57,925 --> 00:42:59,694
Please...

393
00:43:44,338 --> 00:43:45,606
What is all this?

394
00:44:19,107 --> 00:44:20,475
Not bad.

395
00:44:20,541 --> 00:44:23,044
I thought you could not even hold a sword.

396
00:44:25,113 --> 00:44:26,914
Is that why you attacked me from behind?

397
00:44:27,381 --> 00:44:29,951
Why do you lock up and kill the innocent?

398
00:44:30,017 --> 00:44:31,886
Do you believe what they say?

399
00:44:32,453 --> 00:44:35,156
Those Baekje wretches lie
with every breath.

400
00:44:35,690 --> 00:44:39,093
They will shoot us in the back
the moment they are free!

401
00:44:39,794 --> 00:44:41,195
Are you so afraid of Baekje?

402
00:44:42,663 --> 00:44:44,332
Only a weakling would say that.

403
00:44:44,398 --> 00:44:47,001
Then release them beyond the gates.

404
00:44:48,169 --> 00:44:49,770
If you keep seeking revenge,

405
00:44:50,238 --> 00:44:52,473
they will seek vengeance in return.

406
00:44:55,443 --> 00:44:59,180
What do you know of war?

407
00:45:00,248 --> 00:45:02,316
I know the reasons we lose.

408
00:45:04,051 --> 00:45:05,686
A fortress built on hatred...

409
00:45:06,487 --> 00:45:08,156
is bound to fall.

410
00:45:12,793 --> 00:45:14,295
A fortress of hatred?

411
00:45:18,399 --> 00:45:19,500
I see now.

412
00:45:20,368 --> 00:45:22,003
Did your father...

413
00:45:22,336 --> 00:45:24,038
send you to test me?

414
00:45:25,139 --> 00:45:27,108
My father is not like you!

415
00:45:33,014 --> 00:45:34,282
Take your father...

416
00:45:35,683 --> 00:45:37,752
back to Seorabeol soon.

417
00:45:39,053 --> 00:45:41,522
The reason I did not tell
my father of your true nature is...

418
00:45:43,291 --> 00:45:44,926
that Go Ta So asked me not to.

419
00:45:45,993 --> 00:45:48,329
I held my tongue
because this fortress will stand...

420
00:45:49,263 --> 00:45:50,965
even with a fool like you in charge.

421
00:45:52,500 --> 00:45:54,569
However, if you continue
with this tyranny,

422
00:45:56,037 --> 00:45:57,872
you will lose this position as well.

423
00:46:12,386 --> 00:46:14,822
(Pyongyangseong, Goguryeo)

424
00:47:37,238 --> 00:47:38,239
Please sit.

425
00:47:43,644 --> 00:47:44,679
Your Majesty.

426
00:47:46,247 --> 00:47:50,518
Is this truly what you want?

427
00:47:56,757 --> 00:47:58,359
Thirty years ago,

428
00:47:59,260 --> 00:48:03,130
Emperor Yang of Sui
attacked Goguryeo with a million men.

429
00:48:03,564 --> 00:48:06,834
His commander, Lai Hu'er,
led an army of 40,000,

430
00:48:06,901 --> 00:48:11,038
yet you beat him with just 500 men
and saved Pyongyangseong.

431
00:48:13,074 --> 00:48:16,444
The great Ko Geon Mu!

432
00:48:19,413 --> 00:48:20,781
Then how...

433
00:48:21,849 --> 00:48:25,886
have you become a king
who breaks his people's hearts...

434
00:48:25,953 --> 00:48:27,988
by humiliating yourself,

435
00:48:28,055 --> 00:48:33,427
destroying war monuments,
and sending your son as a pledge of peace?

436
00:48:51,912 --> 00:48:53,447
That is your throne.

437
00:48:54,782 --> 00:48:58,819
Apologize to your people
and announce your alliance with me.

438
00:48:59,620 --> 00:49:03,491
Then I will let you sit there again.

439
00:49:04,091 --> 00:49:05,893
You fool!

440
00:49:07,361 --> 00:49:12,266
Li Shimin and his empire
are nothing like the Sui Empire.

441
00:49:13,100 --> 00:49:14,735
Your reckless behavior...

442
00:49:15,369 --> 00:49:16,871
will bring unrest to Goguryeo,

443
00:49:16,937 --> 00:49:20,474
and the people's resentment
will tear you to shreds.

444
00:49:20,541 --> 00:49:22,076
You are wrong!

445
00:49:23,711 --> 00:49:28,048
Hiding like a timid rat for fear of war...

446
00:49:28,115 --> 00:49:32,286
only invites invasion
and brings war to our doorstep.

447
00:49:32,353 --> 00:49:35,156
That is how you will condemn
our people to death.

448
00:49:36,290 --> 00:49:41,695
Why must our people
hide behind fortress walls?

449
00:49:42,329 --> 00:49:43,464
If we lack land,

450
00:49:44,098 --> 00:49:47,968
I will take land that belongs to others.

451
00:49:48,702 --> 00:49:50,471
If anyone is starving,

452
00:49:51,105 --> 00:49:53,607
I will steal food to feed them.

453
00:49:54,208 --> 00:49:56,076
You have managed
to manipulate and entice...

454
00:49:56,644 --> 00:49:59,780
the nobles and commoners
with your wicked schemes.

455
00:50:25,239 --> 00:50:26,841
Years ago,

456
00:50:27,575 --> 00:50:30,845
your ancestor, King Yangwon,

457
00:50:31,612 --> 00:50:33,881
reached far north during his reign.

458
00:50:35,549 --> 00:50:36,717
Now that I think about it,

459
00:50:37,585 --> 00:50:43,357
the descendants of those traitors
are all gathered here.

460
00:50:44,525 --> 00:50:46,727
Our people shed their blood...

461
00:50:47,495 --> 00:50:50,498
while the traitors' descendants...

462
00:50:51,165 --> 00:50:54,134
lived in luxury for generations.

463
00:50:54,735 --> 00:50:58,506
The common people's blood and tears
are what defended Goguryeo,

464
00:50:59,773 --> 00:51:06,614
yet these men act like they alone
protected this kingdom from Sui.

465
00:51:07,181 --> 00:51:08,349
That is what you...

466
00:51:09,683 --> 00:51:11,018
and these fools have done.

467
00:51:12,286 --> 00:51:13,888
I see.

468
00:51:14,788 --> 00:51:17,758
You are consumed by your insecurities.

469
00:51:18,726 --> 00:51:22,897
Do you covet the throne
of the man who defeated Sui?

470
00:51:31,105 --> 00:51:34,308
If you defeated Sui,

471
00:51:34,875 --> 00:51:39,713
then I, Yeon Gae So Mun,
will crush the arrogant Tang!

472
00:51:39,780 --> 00:51:42,683
I cannot let a delusional fool like you...

473
00:51:43,417 --> 00:51:45,786
bring Goguryeo to ruin.

474
00:51:48,556 --> 00:51:49,723
Is that so?

475
00:52:10,778 --> 00:52:11,779
Give him a sword.

476
00:52:23,057 --> 00:52:24,458
All of you, leave!

477
00:52:26,026 --> 00:52:27,528
Stay and watch.

478
00:52:29,363 --> 00:52:30,798
I will strike anyone...

479
00:52:32,199 --> 00:52:33,601
who averts their eyes.

480
00:52:48,916 --> 00:52:52,419
He is a valuable servant of Goguryeo!

481
00:52:53,287 --> 00:52:56,323
More like a useless stray dog.

482
00:52:56,390 --> 00:52:58,359
How dare you!

483
00:53:33,193 --> 00:53:34,595
You bastard!

484
00:54:24,144 --> 00:54:25,412
Such loyalty.

485
00:54:51,271 --> 00:54:53,841
Must I hand Goguryeo over...

486
00:54:54,808 --> 00:54:56,944
to this madman?

487
00:54:58,512 --> 00:55:02,883
Do you not fear heaven's judgment?

488
00:55:20,768 --> 00:55:22,469
Gae So Mun.

489
00:55:23,937 --> 00:55:27,207
Wielding a sword
does not make you powerful.

490
00:55:28,742 --> 00:55:30,477
A truly powerful man...

491
00:55:32,412 --> 00:55:34,148
waits for the right time to fight.

492
00:55:35,582 --> 00:55:36,850
He holds back.

493
00:55:37,718 --> 00:55:39,386
He knows how to be patient.

494
00:55:40,420 --> 00:55:42,623
A man who protects his people...

495
00:55:44,191 --> 00:55:46,226
is a true hero.

496
00:55:48,529 --> 00:55:50,597
Do not sacrifice Goguryeo...

497
00:55:52,566 --> 00:55:54,468
for the sake of your ambition.

498
00:55:57,004 --> 00:55:58,238
Protect Goguryeo...

499
00:56:01,642 --> 00:56:03,610
and its people...

500
00:56:07,447 --> 00:56:08,615
to the very end.

501
00:56:10,984 --> 00:56:12,085
In the name...

502
00:56:13,887 --> 00:56:15,756
of the young hero...

503
00:56:20,527 --> 00:56:22,029
who prevailed over Sui.

504
00:56:35,142 --> 00:56:37,744
With my sword,

505
00:56:39,213 --> 00:56:42,216
I will awaken...

506
00:56:43,050 --> 00:56:47,054
the spirit of Goguryeo!

507
00:56:52,125 --> 00:56:54,428
(Daeyaseong, Silla)

508
00:57:03,871 --> 00:57:05,806
Sir, it is Geom Il.

509
00:57:08,775 --> 00:57:10,143
Enter.

510
00:57:16,383 --> 00:57:17,985
The minister wishes to see you.

511
00:57:34,368 --> 00:57:35,402
My wife?

512
00:57:44,978 --> 00:57:46,113
The wife...

513
00:57:47,180 --> 00:57:51,285
you said you had thrown out
dared to remain within the fortress.

514
00:57:52,352 --> 00:57:54,688
You dared to lie to my face...

515
00:57:55,255 --> 00:57:57,858
and hide a Baekje woman in my domain?

516
00:57:59,359 --> 00:58:00,727
You are mistaken, sir.

517
00:58:01,161 --> 00:58:02,863
- I meant...
- General.

518
00:58:12,940 --> 00:58:14,408
I am at fault.

519
00:58:16,076 --> 00:58:18,011
I could not bear to send her away.

520
00:58:23,984 --> 00:58:25,919
Every night within these walls,

521
00:58:27,020 --> 00:58:31,058
I am driven mad by nightmares
of Baekje and its people.

522
00:58:35,829 --> 00:58:38,031
And you dare do this?

523
00:58:40,500 --> 00:58:41,501
All of this...

524
00:58:42,302 --> 00:58:43,704
is my fault.

525
00:59:24,678 --> 00:59:26,847
So you are weary of this place?

526
00:59:31,118 --> 00:59:34,221
Have you come to finally
strip me of my position?

527
00:59:35,756 --> 00:59:40,794
Would I have come just to do that,
Governor Kim Pum Seok?

528
00:59:43,730 --> 00:59:47,067
Silla is facing a critical moment
in its history.

529
00:59:48,468 --> 00:59:50,504
Losing this fortress will threaten...

530
00:59:51,104 --> 00:59:52,939
not only our Queen, but all of Seorabeol.

531
00:59:53,006 --> 00:59:55,642
This fortress will never fall.

532
00:59:55,709 --> 00:59:59,279
Not a single Baekje arrow
has breached these walls!

533
01:00:06,153 --> 01:00:09,523
You should have defended the province
with this confidence.

534
01:00:09,589 --> 01:00:11,725
You lost 40 fortresses!

535
01:00:18,765 --> 01:00:22,402
Why did rumors of collusion
between Baekje and the Gaya people...

536
01:00:22,469 --> 01:00:25,906
start in the land you govern
when they are the people you hate most?

537
01:00:25,972 --> 01:00:27,474
That is nonsense!

538
01:00:45,158 --> 01:00:47,928
Do you think I do not know what you did?

539
01:00:48,995 --> 01:00:51,465
Do you think I cannot see...

540
01:00:51,998 --> 01:00:55,635
how your twisted hatred for Baekje
is hurting the people?

541
01:01:03,410 --> 01:01:04,644
Did you refuse...

542
01:01:05,278 --> 01:01:08,315
to send Baek Ryong reinforcements
because you hated him?

543
01:01:09,716 --> 01:01:11,118
"Refuse Baek Ryong"?

544
01:01:11,885 --> 01:01:13,353
The beacon was not lit,

545
01:01:13,420 --> 01:01:16,556
and by the time I heard,
Sokhamseong had already fallen!

546
01:01:18,558 --> 01:01:22,195
You suffered from Bi Dam's rumors.

547
01:01:23,597 --> 01:01:25,565
How could you say that to me?

548
01:01:27,234 --> 01:01:30,871
Daeyaseong might also have fallen
if I had gone to help!

549
01:01:34,141 --> 01:01:38,111
You fail to see
what is actually important.

550
01:01:40,614 --> 01:01:41,681
What?

551
01:01:41,748 --> 01:01:45,819
You cannot defeat Baekje with old tactics
created by incompetent Jingol generals!

552
01:01:48,722 --> 01:01:49,956
This fortress...

553
01:01:50,924 --> 01:01:53,059
has been ready for a long time.

554
01:01:53,660 --> 01:01:56,229
If Baekje invades,
I will eradicate the threat...

555
01:01:56,296 --> 01:01:58,265
by killing every Baekje descendant
within the fortress.

556
01:01:58,665 --> 01:02:01,501
We can last a whole year
without Seorabeol's help!

557
01:02:04,070 --> 01:02:05,071
So...

558
01:02:06,206 --> 01:02:08,074
you can leave without worry.

559
01:02:11,478 --> 01:02:12,579
Pum Seok.

560
01:02:16,016 --> 01:02:17,851
You mentioned Bi Dam.

561
01:02:19,920 --> 01:02:21,288
He said...

562
01:02:23,256 --> 01:02:25,792
his leg was injured
because I did not help him in a battle.

563
01:02:27,194 --> 01:02:30,864
All that man does
is blame others and scheme!

564
01:02:34,534 --> 01:02:35,669
The thing is,

565
01:02:37,537 --> 01:02:39,839
I deliberately did not help him.

566
01:02:42,609 --> 01:02:44,711
I hoped he had died that day.

567
01:02:46,213 --> 01:02:47,247
What?

568
01:02:47,314 --> 01:02:49,482
I only care about Silla's future.

569
01:02:51,418 --> 01:02:54,487
I am still deciding
whether you are worth saving.

570
01:03:13,306 --> 01:03:15,442
I came here to see...

571
01:03:16,676 --> 01:03:18,712
whether you were still useful...

572
01:03:18,778 --> 01:03:21,147
or if Baekje returned
a useless shell of a man.

573
01:03:29,222 --> 01:03:30,223
Listen carefully.

574
01:03:31,458 --> 01:03:34,494
Do you know why I have spoken
so harshly to you today?

575
01:03:35,895 --> 01:03:37,697
Any Silla commander...

576
01:03:38,965 --> 01:03:41,468
would have done what you did, even me.

577
01:03:42,302 --> 01:03:44,237
Hatred for Baekje...

578
01:03:45,705 --> 01:03:47,374
can make anyone lose their mind.

579
01:03:54,681 --> 01:03:56,149
It is not too late.

580
01:04:06,059 --> 01:04:10,830
(Kim Pum Seok, Silla's general)

581
01:04:12,232 --> 01:04:13,233
This is why...

582
01:04:14,801 --> 01:04:17,137
I have kept your victory banner.

583
01:04:18,371 --> 01:04:20,240
The Kim Pum Seok I know...

584
01:04:20,707 --> 01:04:23,643
once rivaled Kim Yu Sin.

585
01:04:25,745 --> 01:04:26,913
I still believe...

586
01:04:30,417 --> 01:04:32,619
you can become that man again.

587
01:05:07,087 --> 01:05:09,456
(Sabiseong, Baekje)

588
01:05:15,895 --> 01:05:17,564
I, General Yun Chung,

589
01:05:17,630 --> 01:05:19,833
am ready to go to war.

590
01:05:20,934 --> 01:05:24,437
Give me the order to attack Daeyaseong.

591
01:05:24,504 --> 01:05:27,607
- Give the order, Your Majesty.
- Give the order, Your Majesty.

592
01:05:27,841 --> 01:05:28,842
Your Majesty.

593
01:05:50,964 --> 01:05:51,965
(Goguryeo)

594
01:05:52,031 --> 01:05:53,900
Goguryeo has a new ruler.

595
01:05:54,734 --> 01:05:58,438
Yeon Gae So Mun has seized control
through a rebellion.

596
01:05:58,505 --> 01:06:00,407
Minister Seong Chung just sent word.

597
01:06:01,007 --> 01:06:02,308
Ko Geon Mu is dead?

598
01:06:06,346 --> 01:06:07,480
Heaven...

599
01:06:08,648 --> 01:06:09,916
has given me...

600
01:06:11,117 --> 01:06:13,686
a chance to destroy Silla.

601
01:06:18,558 --> 01:06:21,928
You want us to join forces
and attack Silla?

602
01:06:22,462 --> 01:06:26,666
Goguryeo's involvement alone
would cause great confusion in Silla.

603
01:06:26,900 --> 01:06:28,701
If Silla were to fall,

604
01:06:28,768 --> 01:06:31,104
you would benefit a great deal as well.

605
01:06:38,111 --> 01:06:41,848
What is it that you want?

606
01:06:42,515 --> 01:06:44,317
If you could lend us your men...

607
01:06:46,820 --> 01:06:49,489
What would you give me...

608
01:06:51,357 --> 01:06:54,027
in return for my army?

609
01:06:55,361 --> 01:06:59,332
(Great Goguryeo)

610
01:07:05,305 --> 01:07:07,707
- March out.
- Yes, Supreme Commander.

611
01:07:09,242 --> 01:07:11,511
March out!

612
01:07:11,578 --> 01:07:12,779
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

613
01:07:26,626 --> 01:07:29,262
Yes, you are right.

614
01:07:29,329 --> 01:07:31,264
Look at you, child.

615
01:07:31,898 --> 01:07:34,400
You look more like your mother every day.

616
01:07:46,446 --> 01:07:49,182
(Sword & Silence)

617
01:07:50,450 --> 01:07:52,785
(Thanks to Cho Seong Ha
for his special appearance.)

618
01:08:17,777 --> 01:08:19,245
Do you not hear it?

619
01:08:20,880 --> 01:08:22,448
It is the sound of war.

620
01:08:22,515 --> 01:08:24,584
What? Goguryeo is participating?

621
01:08:24,651 --> 01:08:26,419
Father, it is Daeyaseong.

622
01:08:26,686 --> 01:08:28,388
Daeyaseong is of great value,

623
01:08:28,454 --> 01:08:30,223
but Silla is even greater.

624
01:08:30,823 --> 01:08:32,225
We must go to Dangseong.

625
01:08:32,292 --> 01:08:33,927
My sister is all I want to protect.

626
01:08:33,993 --> 01:08:36,462
Even if it means seizing
blood-stained power,

627
01:08:36,529 --> 01:08:38,565
we must set Silla right!

628
01:08:38,631 --> 01:08:41,434
Just say you wish to be king!
